@startuml lld-us1-class
title LLD-US1 Log in with customer ID and password: class diagram
skinparam monochrome true
hide empty members
class LoginController <<controller>> {
  + login(id, pwd)
}
class AuthService <<service>> {
  - failedCount
  + checkPassword(id, pwd): bool
}
class CustomerRepo <<repository>> {
  + find(id)
}
LoginController --> AuthService : uses
AuthService --> CustomerRepo : reads
@enduml